title: guard_greeting
character: guard
language: en
---
Guard: Halt! Who goes there? #loc:guard_hello_001
Player: It's me, a traveler. #loc:guard_player_intro_001
Guard: State your business. #loc:guard_purpose_001
-> I'm looking for the merchant. #loc:guard_opt_merchant_001
   Guard: He's in the eastern market. #loc:guard_merchant_directions_001
   <<end>>
-> I'm just passing through. #loc:guard_opt_passing_001
   Guard: Then move along. #loc:guard_dismissal_001
   <<end>>
-> None of your business. #loc:guard_opt_hostile_001
   Guard: *draws sword* Then you leave me no choice. #loc:guard_hostile_001
   <<end>>
Guard: Good day to you. #loc:guard_farewell_001
<<end>>
